WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
A café workspace shows sales, costs, and monthly profit.

00:05.000 --> 00:12.000
Coffee bean costs rise 30%. Monthly profit falls from €3,280 to €2,416.

00:12.000 --> 00:20.000
Ask Melt: Add a break-even view and let me adjust opening hours.

00:20.000 --> 00:25.000
A new view and a Monday control appear. Existing assumptions stay in place.

00:25.000 --> 00:35.000
Close on Mondays. In this scenario, monthly profit rises to €2,836.

00:35.000 --> 00:40.000
Disconnect the model. The saved Python action still runs locally.

00:40.000 --> 00:42.000
Restart Melt and restore the saved workspace.

00:42.000 --> 00:48.000
The same controls, assumptions, and results return.
